          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musengwa Katonda Afuga Amagye akoba ati: “Ensi eno eri ng'oti irungu, eziramu bantu waire ensolo, eriiramu okubaamu ebyayiro abaayi mwe batwala ensolo dhaibwe okuliira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaayi baliiramu kabiri okubaliranga ebyayo byaibwe mu bibuga eby'omu biketezo eby'oku nsozi, n'eby'omu biketezo eby'omu biiko, n'eby'omu biketezo bya Buyudaaya ebikalukalu ebiri ku luuyi olw'omukono omusaadha olw'e buvandhuba, ni mu biketezo bya Benjamini, ni mu byalo ebyezungulwire Yerusalemu, ni mu bibuga eby'omu Buyudaaya. Nze Musengwa Katonda, ninze nkobye.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
