          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musengwa Katonda yankoba ati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Yeremia, oboine abantu bwe bali kukoba bati nalekulira agho abantu ab'omu Isiraeli n'ab'omu Buyudaaya, endhu edho eibiri dhe nalonda? Kale banhooma abantu bange abo baaloba kubatwala ng'eighanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye nze Musengwa Katonda nakola endagaano n'omusana era naakola endagaano n'obwire, nti bibengagho mu kiseera kyabyo ekituufu. Era endagaano eyo ghazira asobola kugimenhagho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale ni ng'endagaano eyo bw'etasobola kumenhebwagho, zeena ntyo bwe ntalisobola kulekulira agho baidhukulu ba Yakobo n'aba Daudi omugheereza wange, ni ntalonda owundi ku baidhukulu be afugenga baidhukulu ba Aburahamu, n'aba Isaaka, n'aba Yakobo. Bwenebwene ndigemerwa abantu bange ekisa, naabaleetera ebintu byairamu okubajiiranga obukalamu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
